# Git attribution

Never add any of the following to commits, commit messages, or pull requests:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Co-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Made with Cursor`
- Any other AI tool attribution trailer or footer

When creating commits, use only the user's message. Do not append co-author lines or marketing trailers.
